.TH KSTAR-NEW 1 "" "Kleene Star" "Kleene Star Manual"
.SH NAME
kstar\-new \- start a new program from a template
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fBkstar new\fR <name>
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Writes <name>.kstar, a small working program to start from. An existing
file is never overwritten.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
\fBkstar new lab1\fR
write lab1.kstar
.TP
\fBkstar run lab1.kstar\fR
then run it
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBkstar\fR(1),
\fBkstar\-help\fR(1)
.PP
The reference and the tutorial: https://github.com/Pratham71/kleene\-star
